WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.630
There is so much to see and do at Disneyland.

2
00:00:04.631 --> 00:00:09.203
Have you been to Disneyland?

3
00:00:09.204 --> 00:00:12.215
Mom: Which ride do you want to go on first?

4
00:00:12.216 --> 00:00:14.612
Hana: The roller coaster!

5
00:00:14.613 --> 00:00:18.966
Bada: No, I want to go on the balloon ride!

6
00:00:18.967 --> 00:00:22.070
Mom: We can do both!

7
00:00:22.071 --> 00:00:24.709
Bada: We’re up so high!

8
00:00:24.710 --> 00:00:27.158
Hana: I feel like I’m flying.

9
00:00:27.159 --> 00:00:29.268
Mom: Sit down, Hana!

10
00:00:29.269 --> 00:00:33.318
Bada: They look like ants.

11
00:00:33.319 --> 00:00:36.315
Mom: What do you want to ride next?

12
00:00:36.316 --> 00:00:39.376
Hana: Can we ride the bumper cars?

13
00:00:39.377 --> 00:00:43.395
Bada: But I want to see Mickey Mouse!

14
00:00:43.396 --> 00:00:47.528
Mom: I’m sure we’ll see him soon,

15
00:00:47.529 --> 00:00:51.089
Bada. Bada: Bam! I got you,

16
00:00:51.090 --> 00:00:53.636
Mommy! Hana: Bam! Look out,

17
00:00:53.637 --> 00:00:55.889
Bada! I’m following you!

18
00:00:55.890 --> 00:00:59.519
Mom: Oh . . . Hana! Here I come!

19
00:00:59.520 --> 00:01:03.829
Hana: Mommy! Let’s get Bada!

20
00:01:03.830 --> 00:01:06.437
Mom: Let’s have some cotton candy.

21
00:01:06.438 --> 00:01:10.273
Bada: Yummy! This tastes good.

22
00:01:10.274 --> 00:01:13.201
Hana: Oh, it’s so hot!

23
00:01:13.202 --> 00:01:17.954
Mom: I know a great way to cool down!

24
00:01:17.955 --> 00:01:21.402
Hana: Look at the fireworks!

25
00:01:21.403 --> 00:01:24.177
Bada: My ears hurt.

26
00:01:24.178 --> 00:01:26.795
Hana: The show’s about to begin.

27
00:01:26.796 --> 00:01:31.722
Mom: Look, Bada! It’s Mickey Mouse!

28
00:01:31.723 --> 00:01:38.243
Disneyland is not only fun for children, but it’s also fun for adults.

29
00:01:38.244 --> 00:01:42.966
I want to go again!

